 YesOrNoWithoutStatusbar;myGuiParms;parms
⍝ Presents a "Yes" and a "No" button together with a message and without status bar.
 myGuiParms←##.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 myGuiParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 parms←##.GUI.Dialogs.CreateParmsForYesOrNo
 parms.(hasProgressbar hasStatusbar)←2⍴0
 ⎕←parms myGuiParms ##.GUI.Dialogs.YesOrNo'Are you really sure about this?'
